## 포트 매핑 실행 #1 (호스트 8080 → 컨테이너 80)

$ docker run -d -p 8080:80 --name my-web-8080 my-web:1.0
7e3dca34d5f3534d512ee0507e699594f703dfd6287ff0cc5d514e59629a067b

$ curl -s http://localhost:8080 | grep -o "<h1>.*</h1>"
<h1>Hello, Codyssey!</h1>

$ curl -s http://localhost:8080/health
ok

## 포트 매핑 실행 #2 (호스트 8081 → 컨테이너 80, 같은 이미지)

$ docker run -d -p 8081:80 --name my-web-8081 my-web:1.0
4a34d38615b8f671f680a015192ca265d468f9494e0bc4922d097ce70cfc7390

$ curl -s http://localhost:8081 | grep -o "<h1>.*</h1>"
<h1>Hello, Codyssey!</h1>

## 포트 충돌 재현 (이미 사용 중인 8080 재사용) → 트러블슈팅 2

$ docker run -d -p 8080:80 --name my-web-conflict my-web:1.0
eb785343c0a691c26b9417ac4f5fd457a8ae4faf6d15bfdc478a960497fc7228
docker: Error response from daemon: failed to set up container networking: driver failed programming external connectivity on endpoint my-web-conflict (2723303574c2bb4756c4c4c230e8e8964c9f3475f2f85f04f9bcee32f9365c17): Bind for :::8080 failed: port is already allocated

Run 'docker run --help' for more information

$ docker rm -f my-web-conflict
my-web-conflict

## 환경 변수 주입: 컨테이너 내부 포트 8000, 모드 prod

$ docker run -d -p 8082:8000 -e NGINX_PORT=8000 -e APP_MODE=prod --name my-web-prod my-web:1.0
b55bf5dcb1007574d0d411548c20b5113617cd5920ea66a47ba6aef67ff4a892

$ curl -s http://localhost:8082/info
{"app_mode":"prod","listen_port":"8000"}

$ curl -s http://localhost:8080/info
{"app_mode":"dev","listen_port":"80"}

